                        ],
                        "form": "тала́нте"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "6c34a0aa-6f33-4d8c-bbe1-828f1cf33885",
                        "entry_id": "d11bfe2c-89a4-3951-9af4-e61ff559d289",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "тала́нтах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "268c93d4-d7b6-3605-8e09-8e99fce6c992",
                        "entry_id": "d11bfe2c-89a4-3951-9af4-e61ff559d289",
                        "glosses": [
                            "выдающиеся природные способности; врождённая одарённость"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2859d233-7b04-45b8-901d-2329f77e8017",
                                "sense_id": "268c93d4-d7b6-3605-8e09-8e99fce6c992",
                                "text": "Такое произведение, при великом таланте, уже принадлежало бы не столько к русской литературе, сколько к русской истории."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "239bff16-da6d-4e67-bca4-174cf922b2c2",
                                "sense_id": "268c93d4-d7b6-3605-8e09-8e99fce6c992",
                                "text": "Объёмистый труд Босуэлла на редкость точно запечатлел незаурядный джонсоновский талант парадоксального остроумия, который современники не колеблясь сравнивали с сократовским."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "43efd185-91a3-3198-9c87-f7da95f7ccad",
                        "entry_id": "d11bfe2c-89a4-3951-9af4-e61ff559d289",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. способность, умение"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7ec85387-198f-4131-8560-e0faa8237ce8",
                                "sense_id": "43efd185-91a3-3198-9c87-f7da95f7ccad",
                                "text": "Титулярный советник с колбасиками начинает таять, но желает тоже выразить свои чувства, и как только он начинает выражать их, так начинает горячиться и говорить грубости, и опять я должен пускать в ход все свои дипломатические таланты."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e7aa125a-80f0-3be5-a264-47ab500add02",
                        "entry_id": "d11bfe2c-89a4-3951-9af4-e61ff559d289",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. человек с выдающимися способностями, дарованием"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "47565fec-b055-4ff8-99a5-d18d9163c8ed",
                                "sense_id": "e7aa125a-80f0-3be5-a264-47ab500add02",
                                "text": "Вот это талант!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2a33b5b6-3fee-44ac-a707-a9235dff6942",
                                "sense_id": "e7aa125a-80f0-3be5-a264-47ab500add02",
                                "text": "Мало того, я уверен, что тысячи талантов и умников, столь возвышающихся, если б вдруг навалить на них ротшильдские миллионы, тут же не выдержали бы и поступили бы как самая пошлая ординарность и давили бы пуще всех."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0ebe5b22-f988-3bc2-b9da-fa1cde07ad04",
                        "entry_id": "d11bfe2c-89a4-3951-9af4-e61ff559d289",
                        "glosses": [
                            "истор. крупная единица веса в ряде стран Древнего мира"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "63dafc65-a539-3a7b-b2ba-0df17e422bf4",
                        "entry_id": "d11bfe2c-89a4-3951-9af4-e61ff559d289",
                        "glosses": [
                            "истор. крупная денежная единица в ряде стран Древнего мира"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6c44b075-b548-408c-8693-f7dc0dd5aae5",
                        "source_entry_id": "d11bfe2c-89a4-3951-9af4-e61ff559d289",
                        "source_sense_description": "выдающиеся природные способности; врождённая одарённость",
                        "target_lang_word": "talent",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "talent",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1f893a97-b560-3e92-865a-8a5690f6ab83",
                                        "entry_id": "348d3b3f-4497-386a-b600-afe039894b61",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A marked natural ability or skill."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2fbb6178-54bf-436b-9517-f15f6eb9255b",
                                                "sense_id": "1f893a97-b560-3e92-865a-8a5690f6ab83",
                                                "text": "Feel awfully about Scott... I always knew he couldn't think—he never could—but he had a marvelous talent and the thing is to use it—not whine in public."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ba869da-60f8-4fa6-9dc1-e5270362018f",
                                                "sense_id": "1f893a97-b560-3e92-865a-8a5690f6ab83",
                                                "text": "He has a real talent for drawing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0109efae-655f-3281-a412-fb2f93abfb8e",
                                        "entry_id": "348d3b3f-4497-386a-b600-afe039894b61",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A unit of weight and money used in ancient times in Greece, the Roman Empire, and the Middle East, equal to about 30 to 60 kg in various times and places."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07f64535-190f-4989-a0d0-bef8f4362c07",
                                                "sense_id": "0109efae-655f-3281-a412-fb2f93abfb8e",
                                                "text": "For the kingdom of heaven is as a man travelling into a far country, who called his own servants, and delivered unto them his goods. And unto one he gave five talents, to another two, and to another one; to every man according to his several ability; and straightway took his journey."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e045e766-2153-3c9a-9691-0d4f4413284a",
                                        "entry_id": "348d3b3f-4497-386a-b600-afe039894b61",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A desire or inclination for something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "caf3832f-bd60-3e6b-90e5-3e7732349ff1",
                                        "entry_id": "348d3b3f-4497-386a-b600-afe039894b61",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "People of talent, viewed collectively; a talented person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1fdbaaec-f93d-4f49-a7c8-e7e615f5790d",
                                                "sense_id": "caf3832f-bd60-3e6b-90e5-3e7732349ff1",
                                                "text": "The director searched their talent pool to fill the new opening."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "724c9edd-1afc-4da5-9eda-f1e15757b5b0",
                                                "sense_id": "caf3832f-bd60-3e6b-90e5-3e7732349ff1",
                                                "text": "And all over Hollywood, suits are licking their chops at the prospect of more malleable actors. “She’s not going to talk back,” one top talent wrangler told me dryly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f1fad48a-46eb-3198-b656-a996073fba80",
                                        "entry_id": "348d3b3f-4497-386a-b600-afe039894b61",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The men or (especially) women of a place or area, judged by their attractiveness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c2cb168-2232-4308-ad67-710b4a7e5be7",
                                                "sense_id": "f1fad48a-46eb-3198-b656-a996073fba80",
                                                "text": "Not much talent in this bar tonight—let's hit the clubs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28a9c2c1-dc8f-4b2f-84ea-e8628764bfe3",
                                                "sense_id": "f1fad48a-46eb-3198-b656-a996073fba80",
                                                "text": "I went down to the beach front, of course, for that was the first thing that all Vaalies did: to look at the sea and to check the talent on the beach."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6d70197f-1a4d-4ffc-9f58-742a26c3ddf9",
                        "source_entry_id": "d11bfe2c-89a4-3951-9af4-e61ff559d289",
                        "source_sense_description": "выдающиеся природные способности; врождённая одарённость",
